ody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">$10/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$12/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$16/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.2.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 21st, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\nNot to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Marbles\" title=\"Marbles\">Marbles</a>, a ball that can be bought at <a href=\"/wiki/Alan%27s_AutoLogistics\" title=\"Alan&#39;s AutoLogistics\">Alan's AutoLogistics</a>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Marble</b> is one of the 5 nodes that can spawn around Finlay Island. These nodes can be found in elevated areas, most notably the <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>. They are commonly found as large white nodes.  \n</p><p>These nodes can spawn in a medium range of sizes.\n</p><p>Note: <b><a href=\"/wiki/Gold\" title=\"Gold\">Gold</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rose_Gold\" title=\"Rose Gold\">Rose Gold</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Copper\" title=\"Copper\">Copper</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Iron\" title=\"Iron\">Iron</a></b> <b>will not spawn in Marble deposits as of update 1.67.0.</b>\n</p>\n<h5><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"The_chart_below_displays_all_possible_ores_that_spawn_within_this_node.\">The chart below displays all possible ores that spawn within this node.</span></h5>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Picture</th>\n<th>Name</th>\n<th>Notes\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/de/QuartzRAW.png/revision/latest?cb=20230122081148\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"QuartzRAW\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"128\" height=\"123\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"QuartzRAW.png\" data-image-key=\"QuartzRAW.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/de/QuartzRAW.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/128?cb=20230122081148\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Quartz\" title=\"Quartz\">Quartz</a></td>\n<td>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/29/RosaFlamaQuartz-RAW.png/revision/latest?cb=20230122080835\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"RosaFlamaQuartz-RAW\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"124\" height=\"128\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"RosaFlamaQuartz-RAW.png\" data-image-key=\"RosaFlamaQuartz-RAW.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/2/29/RosaFlamaQuartz-RAW.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/124?cb=20230122080835\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure></td>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Rosa_Quartz\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rosa Quartz\">Rosa Quartz</a></td>\n<td>1/100\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>It is currently one of the biggest stones in the game.</li>\n<li>The Refined Marble is Slippery like ice (low friction), making it useful for Slippery Builds.</li>\n<li>Marble may appear as a mineral in Lightslate</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Stone_Nav\" title=\"Template:Stone Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Stone_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Stone_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images